      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "class_g_02_home_11",
      "hash64": "897DDF0884E34AC5",
      "text": "[VAR 0xBD06(0000)][VAR 0x0100(0000)]! Wonach sollte man in solch\\neiner\\r\\nSituation\\r\\nAusschau\\r\\nhalten?[VAR 0x0114(0029)]",
